      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we have test cases that show the need to multi-version functions? Is that something that can actually happen?\n\nUnlike the atomics transform, we already know that every single spirv.image parameter will need to be converted, so if there\u0027s no cases where the same function would need to have two different signatures then I think we could simplify a lot of this logic for user calls.",
