      "writtenOn": "2025-05-22T14:08:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll see if I can make one but I was thinking along the lines of:\n\n```\ntexture_2d a;\ntexture_2d b;  // A depth texture from spir-v but depth is 0 because vulkan\n\nfn x(texture_2d c) {\n  textureSample(c);\n}\n\nfn y(texture_2d c) {\n  textureSampleDref(c);\n}\n\nfn main() {\n  x(a);\n  \n  y(b);  // b has to turn to a texture_depth_2d\n  x(b);\n}\n```\n\nI\u0027ll have to see if I can turn that into a real SPIR-V example though.",
      "parentUuid": "ccaa5d43_100e437b",
      "revId": "6b0e64da11b04e9943ddb405b91328f78c649121",
