      "writtenOn": "2025-05-22T14:00:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the point of the test was to ensure that this sort of thing *doesn\u0027t* happen.\n\nWGSL doesn\u0027t support creating pointers to handle types, so we wouldn\u0027t be able to convert these `let` instructions to WGSL.\n\nSo we should probably just have the handling of `let` remove the instruction completely.",
