        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-22T14:00:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do these get inlined when converting to WGSL? I fear that ValueToLet does not inline across control flow boundaries, which would cause them to get stored in `let` declarations. This is what the test was supposed to be guarding against AFAICT, so we probably need to do something like defer the `load` until the point of use (bearing in mind that the load may have multiple uses...).",
